OL,3,GNEWSAThe challenge facing Wales' first
OL,4,Aminister amid independence debate
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Instead of marching in Aberystwyth
OL,7,Fhe'd be better off behind his desk in
OL,8,FCathays Park sorting the problems he
OL,9,Fsaid he would sort out."
OL,11,FThe criticism by Conservative Senedd
OL,12,FMember Andrew RT Davies of the first
OL,13,Fminister sums up what is likely to
OL,14,Fbecome a familiar line of attack over
OL,15,Fthe next four years.
OL,17,FHe is referring to Rhun ap Iorwerth's
OL,18,Fappearance on Saturday at an
OL,19,Findependence rally organised by the
OL,20,Fcampaign group Yes Cymru.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
